    "rubric": "Donalik va kichik buyurtmalar",
    "title": "Taobao: Bolalar shapkasi boshga mosmi?",
    "text": "🧢 <b>TAOBAO’DA BOLALAR SHAPKASI MOS KELADIMI?</b>\n\nShapkani faqat bolaning yoshiga qarab tanlamang. Buyurtmadan oldin bosh aylanasini mahsulot o‘lchami bilan solishtiring.\n\n<b>Immensus Post maslahati:</b>\n1️⃣ Bolaning boshi atrofini santimetrli lenta bilan o‘lchang.\n2️⃣ Taobao’dagi mahsulot sahifasidan o‘lcham jadvalini toping.\n3️⃣ Bosh aylanasini jadvaldagi o‘lcham bilan solishtiring.\n4️⃣ Jadval noaniq bo‘lsa, to‘lovdan oldin sotuvchidan so‘rang.\n\nMasalan, bosh aylanasini yozib olib, sotuvchidan qaysi o‘lcham mosligini so‘rashingiz mumkin.\n\nOnlayn xarid va mahsulot tavsifi haqida: <a href=\"https://scjgj.beijing.gov.cn/zwxx/scjgdt/202503/t20250314_4034752.html\">Manba</a> · <a href=\"https://legalinfo.moj.gov.cn/zhfxfzzx/fzzxyw/202504/t20250405_516956.html\">Manba</a>\n\n📌 Foydali bo'lsa, postni saqlab qo'ying va yaqinlaringizga ulashing. 🔔 Xitoy platformalari bo'yicha sodda qo'llanmalar — @immensuspost\n\n#ImmensusPost #XitoydanBuyurtma #FoydaliMaslahat",
    "kind": "photo",
    "file_id": "AgACAgUAAxkDAAIBeWr_D8UNeP-Cqopp75w9Ibp_4xZUAAJ2EWsbPfUBVM888rDLLCNoAQADAgADeQADPQQ",
    "media_path": "/home/runner/work/immensus-post/immensus-post/.work/20261119-150016/image.png",
    "topic": {
      "title": "Taobao: Bolalar shapkasi boshga mosmi?",
      "angle": "Bolaning bosh aylanasini o‘lchab, mahsulot o‘lchami bilan solishtirish bo‘yicha qisqa tekshiruv ro‘yxati. Jadval noaniq bo‘lsa, sotuvchidan so‘rash.",
      "why_now": "Sovuq mavsumda shapkani faqat yosh ko‘rsatkichiga qarab tanlamaslikka yordam beradi.",
      "research": "**Tekshiruv sanasi: 2026-yil 19-noyabr.** Quyidagi mavzular kundalik xarid uchun dolzarb; ularning dolzarbligi yangi aksiya yoki platforma funksiyasiga bog‘lanmagan. Platforma nomlari mavzu qaysi savatchada yoritilishini bildiradi — har bir aniq mahsulot kartasi alohida tekshirilishi kerak.\n\n1. **Taobao: Tortma uchun quti ichiga sig‘adimi?**\n   - **Burchak:** Tortmaning ichki eni va uzunligini o‘lchash; qutining tashqi o‘lchamlari bilan solishtirish; ma’lumot yo‘q bo‘lsa, sotuvchidan so‘rash.\n   - **Nega hozir:** Uy-ro‘zg‘or buyumlarini yil davomida xarid qilishda rasm o‘lchamni aniq ko‘rsatmasligi mumkin.\n   - **Foydalilik:** 9/10. ([yc.gov.cn](https://www.yc.gov.cn/ycsrmzf/c102646/202201/96535.shtml?utm_source=openai))\n\n2. **Pinduoduo: Paypoq haqiqatan qanday matodan?**\n   - **Burchak:** “Paxtali” degan nomga qarash; tarkib yozilgan joyni topish; ko‘rsatilgan tolalarni solishtirish.\n   - **Nega hozir:** Sovuq mavsumda paypoq tanlashda nomidan ko‘ra tarkibini bilish foydali.\n   - **Foydalilik:** 9/10. ([wuxi.gov.cn](https://www.wuxi.gov.cn/doc/2024/09/04/4386229.shtml?utm_source=openai))\n\n3. **Poizon: Krossovkaning ustki qismi nimadan?**\n   - **Burchak:** Mahsulot tavsifidan ustki materialni topish; uni o‘zingizga kerakli foydalanish holati bilan solishtirish; noaniq bo‘lsa, xariddan oldin so‘rash.\n   - **Nega hozir:** Kuz-qishda krossovka tanlashda faqat tashqi ko‘rinishga emas, materialiga ham qarash foydali.\n   - **Foydalilik:** 8/10. ([dxal.gov.cn](https://www.dxal.gov.cn/dxal/c100141/202507/c13_315234.shtml?utm_source=openai))\n\n4. **Taobao: Daftarda nechta varaq bor?**\n   - **Burchak:** Tavsifda *张* — varaq va *页* — sahifa belgilarini farqlash; sonni tekshirish; noaniq yozuvni sotuvchidan aniqlashtirish.\n   - **Nega hozir:** Maktab va ish uchun daftar xaridida varaq bilan sahifani adashtirmaslik mumkin.\n   - **Foydalilik:** 8/10. ([legalinfo.moj.gov.cn](https://legalinfo.moj.gov.cn/zhfxfzzx/fzzxyw/202408/t20240826_504680.html?utm_source=openai))\n\n5. **Tmall: Krujka siz kutgan kattalikdami?**\n   - **Burchak:** Krujkaning ko‘rsatilgan sig‘imini topish; uni uydagi odatiy krujka bilan solishtirish; sig‘im yozilmagan bo‘lsa, so‘rash.\n   - **Nega hozir:** Issiq ichimliklar mavsumida sovg‘a yoki uy uchun krujka tanlashga mos.\n   - **Foydalilik:** 8/10. ([scjgj.beijing.gov.cn](https://scjgj.beijing.gov.cn/zwxx/scjgdt/202503/t20250314_4034752.html?utm_source=openai))\n\n6. **Pinduoduo: Soyabon sumkangizga joylashadimi?**\n   - **Burchak:** Yig‘ilgan soyabon uzunligini tavsifdan topish; sumkadagi bo‘sh joy bilan solishtirish; faqat ochiq soyabon rasmiga qarab tanlamaslik.\n   - **Nega hozir:** Kuzgi yog‘ingarchilikda yoningizda olib yurishga qulay soyabon tanlash foydali.\n   - **Foydalilik:** 8/10. ([scjgj.beijing.gov.cn](https://scjgj.beijing.gov.cn/zwxx/scjgdt/202503/t20250314_4034752.html?utm_source=openai))\n\n7. **Taobao: Bolalar shapkasi boshga mos keladimi?**\n   - **Burchak:** Bolaning bosh aylanasini o‘lchash; mahsulotdagi o‘lcham bilan solishtirish; jadval noaniq bo‘lsa, sotuvchidan so‘rash.\n   - **Nega hozir:** Sovuq mavsumda shapkani faqat yosh yozuviga qarab tanlamaslikka yordam beradi.\n   - **Foydalilik:** 9/10. ([scjgj.beijing.gov.cn](https://scjgj.beijing.gov.cn/zwxx/scjgdt/202503/t20250314_4034752.html?utm_source=openai))\n\n8. **Tmall: Sochiqning o‘lchami sizga yetarlimi?**\n   - **Burchak:** Sochiq eni va uzunligini topish; uydagi yoqadigan sochiq bilan solishtirish; bir xil rasmdagi turli o‘lchamlarni tekshirish.\n   - **Nega hozir:** Uy uchun ham, sovg‘a uchun ham foydali; rasmga qarab kattalikni adashtirmaslikka yordam beradi.\n   - **Foydalilik:** 8/10. ([legalinfo.moj.gov.cn](https://legalinfo.moj.gov.cn/zhfxfzzx/fzzxyw/202504/t20250405_516956.html?utm_source=openai))\n\n**Foydalanilgan rasmiy manbalar:**\n\n- Pekin bozor nazorati boshqarmasi, onlayn xarid bo‘yicha maslahatlar, **2025-yil 14-mart**: https://scjgj.beijing.gov.cn/zwxx/scjgdt/202503/t20250314_4034752.html\n- Xitoy Adliya vazirligi platformasi, mahsulot rasmlar",
